flowchart LR
    Client[Client Apps]
    Gateway[API Gateway\nAuth + Rate Limits]
    Retrieval[Retrieval Service]
    ACL[ACL Filter\nTenant + Principal Scope]
    Embed[Query Embedding]
    Hybrid[Hybrid Candidate Fetch\nVector + Keyword]
    Rerank[Optional Reranker]
    Response[Cited Chunk Response]

    Ingest[Ingestion API]
    Parser[Parse + Chunk Workers]
    EmbedWorkers[Embedding Workers]
    Writer[Index Writer]
    Vector[(Vector Index)]
    Metadata[(Metadata DB)]
    Objects[(Object Storage)]

    Client --> Gateway
    Gateway --> Retrieval
    Retrieval --> ACL
    ACL --> Embed
    Embed --> Hybrid
    Hybrid --> Rerank
    Rerank --> Response
    Hybrid --> Response

    Gateway --> Ingest
    Ingest --> Parser
    Parser --> Objects
    Parser --> EmbedWorkers
    EmbedWorkers --> Writer
    Writer --> Vector
    Writer --> Metadata
    Hybrid --> Vector
    ACL --> Metadata
